
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#080c18">
<title>SECURE — Your Digital World, Protected</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

:root {
    --bg: #080c18;
    --blue: #58a6ff;
    --purple: #9470ff;
    --text: #f4f7ff;
    --muted: #929db7;
    --border: rgba(255,255,255,.09);
}

html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
    min-height: 100vh;
    color: var(--text);
    background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 75% 35%, rgba(63,76,180,.15), transparent 40%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 15% 70%, rgba(24,122,205,.10), transparent 40%),
        var(--bg);
    font-family: Inter, "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
    overflow-x: hidden;
}

a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
}

button, a {
    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
}

button:focus-visible, a:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--blue);
    outline-offset: 5px;
}

.container {
    width: min(1120px, 90%);
    margin: auto;
}

/* NAVIGATION */

nav {
    height: 88px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 23px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
}

.brand-icon {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 13px;
    color: white;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #438cff, #8d60ff);
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px #4a75ff35;
}

.links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 35px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
}

.links a:hover {
    color: white;
}

.status {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    padding: 11px 14px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(69,224,161,.2);
    border-radius: 30px;
    color: #75e9b7;
    background: rgba(45,190,129,.06);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
}

.dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    background: #4ee4a0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px #4ee4a0;
}

/* HERO */

.hero {
    min-height: 590px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr .95fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 40px;
    padding: 65px 0 75px;
}

.eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    color: #8bbcff;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 26px;
}

.eyebrow::before {
    content: "";
    width: 24px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--blue);
}

h1 {
    max-width: 590px;
    font-size: clamp(43px, 5.4vw, 70px);
    line-height: 1.07;
    letter-spacing: -3px;
    font-weight: 800;
}

.gradient-text {
    background: linear-gradient(100deg, #69b6ff, #9d83ff 75%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
}

.description {
    max-width: 460px;
    margin-top: 25px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.9;
}

.actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 35px;
}

.primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 15px;
    padding: 15px 22px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    color: white;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    background: linear-gradient(110deg, #398bff, #8062f5);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px #5278ff25;
    transition: transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;
}

.primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 35px #5278ff45;
}

.secondary {
    color: #c0c9df;
    font-size: 13px;
}

.secondary:hover {
    color: white;
}

/* SHIELD ART */

.visual {
    min-height: 390px;
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
}

.orbit {
    position: absolute;
    width: 350px;
    height: 350px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(100,145,255,.14);
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: rotate 28s linear infinite;
}

.orbit::before,
.orbit::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    border: 1px solid rgba(100,145,255,.12);
    border-radius: 50%;
}

.orbit::before {
    inset: 28px;
}

.orbit::after {
    inset: 58px;
}

.orbit-two {
    width: 285px;
    height: 285px;
    border-style: dashed;
    border-color: rgba(145,111,255,.24);
    animation-direction: reverse;
    animation-duration: 38s;
}

.shield-glow {
    position: absolute;
    width: 180px;
    height: 180px;
    background: #477cff;
    filter: blur(85px);
    opacity: .4;
}

.shield {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 175px;
    height: 195px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    clip-path: polygon(50% 0, 94% 17%, 89% 65%, 72% 85%, 50% 100%, 28% 85%, 11% 65%, 6% 17%);
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #82c5ff, #477bff 48%, #825bff);
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 35px #558aff55);
    animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
}

.shield-inner {
    width: 165px;
    height: 185px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    clip-path: polygon(50% 0, 94% 17%, 89% 65%, 72% 85%, 50% 100%, 28% 85%, 11% 65%, 6% 17%);
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #18294e, #10152c 65%, #211b48);
}

.checkmark {
    font-size: 68px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #9cd5ff;
    text-shadow: 0 0 30px #4baaff;
}

.float-card {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 11px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.11);
    border-radius: 13px;
    background: rgba(16,23,43,.85);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 40px #0004;
    backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
}

.float-card.one {
    top: 65px;
    right: -2px;
}

.float-card.two {
    bottom: 55px;
    left: -4px;
}

.mini-icon {
    width: 35px;
    height: 35px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgba(77,151,255,.13);
    font-size: 17px;
}

.float-card strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
}

.float-card small {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 10px;
}

/* FEATURES */

.features {
    padding: 0 0 65px;
}

.section-heading {
    margin-bottom: 28px;
}

.section-heading h2 {
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: -.5px;
}

.section-heading p {
    margin-top: 8px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
}

.feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 18px;
}

.feature {
    padding: 26px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #ffffff08, #ffffff02);
    transition: transform .25s, border-color .25s;
}

.feature:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    border-color: #608cff55;
}

.feature-icon {
    width: 45px;
    height: 45px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(85,137,255,.12);
    font-size: 21px;
}

.feature h3 {
    font-size: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 11px;
}

.feature p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.8;
}

/* FOOTER */

footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.footer-content {
    min-height: 85px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 15px;
    color: #75809a;
    font-size: 11px;
}

.footer-brand {
    color: #c5cce0;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
}

/* ANIMATIONS */

@keyframes rotate {
    to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
}

@keyframes float {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-12px); }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    *, *::before, *::after {
        animation-duration: .01ms !important;
        animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
        transition-duration: .01ms !important;
    }
}

@media (max-width: 800px) {
    .links { gap: 16px; }
    .links a:nth-child(3) { display: none; }
    .status { font-size: 9px; padding: 9px; }
    .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-top: 65px; }
    .hero-content { text-align: center; }
    .eyebrow { justify-content: center; }
    h1, .description { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
    .actions { justify-content: center; }
    .visual { min-height: 360px; }
    .feature-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .feature { padding: 23px; }
}

@media (max-width: 480px) {
    nav { height: 72px; }
    .brand { font-size: 19px; gap: 8px; }
    .brand-icon { width: 35px; height: 35px; }
    .links { gap: 12px; font-size: 12px; }
    .links a:nth-child(2) { display: none; }
    .status { padding: 8px; font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .3px; }
    h1 { font-size: 43px; letter-spacing: -2px; }
    .description { font-size: 14px; }
    .visual { transform: scale(.88); margin: -10px 0; }
    .float-card.one { right: -10px; }
    .float-card.two { left: -10px; }
    .footer-content { padding: 22px 0; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header class="container">
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a class="brand" href="#home" aria-label="Secure home">
            <span class="brand-icon" aria-hidden="true">⬡</span>
            SECURE
        </a>

        <div class="links">
            <a href="#home">Overview</a>
            <a href="#protection">Protection</a>
            <a href="#privacy">Privacy</a>
        </div>

        <div class="status">
            <span class="dot"></span>
            SECURITY INSPIRED
        </div>
    </nav>
</header>

<main>
    <section class="hero container" id="home">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="eyebrow">YOUR DIGITAL WORLD, GUARDED</div>

            <h1>
                Security that<br>
                <span class="gradient-text">moves with you.</span>
            </h1>

            <p class="description">
                A safer digital future starts with smarter choices.
                Discover a world built around privacy, protection,
                and peace of mind.
            </p>

            <div class="actions">
                <a class="primary" href="#protection">
                    Explore Protection <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                </a>

                <a class="secondary" href="#privacy">
                    Discover our vision ↗
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="visual" aria-label="Decorative shield illustration">
            <div class="orbit"></div>
            <div class="orbit orbit-two"></div>
            <div class="shield-glow"></div>

            <div class="shield" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="shield-inner">
                    <span class="checkmark">✓</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="float-card one">
                <div class="mini-icon" aria-hidden="true">✧</div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Privacy first</strong>
                    <small>Your data matters</small>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="float-card two">
                <div class="mini-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌘</div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Think securely</strong>
                    <small>Stay one step ahead</small>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="features container" id="protection">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <h2>Built around what matters.</h2>
            <p>Three principles for a more security-conscious digital life.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-grid">
            <article class="feature">
                <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">◈</div>
                <h3>Smarter Protection</h3>
                <p>
                    Make thoughtful security choices and build
                    safer habits across your digital life.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="feature" id="privacy">
                <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">◉</div>
                <h3>Privacy by Design</h3>
                <p>
                    Treat personal information with care.
                    Share less and stay mindful of your digital footprint.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="feature">
                <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌁</div>
                <h3>Always Aware</h3>
                <p>
                    Recognize suspicious links, use strong unique
                    passwords, and keep your software updated.
                </p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>
</main>

<footer>
    <div class="container footer-content">
        <span class="footer-brand">SECURE.</span>
        <span>Designed for a more security-conscious world.</span>
        <span>© <span id="year"></span> SECURE</span>
    </div>
</footer>

<script>
"use strict";
document.getElementById("year").textContent =
    new Date().getFullYear();
</script>

</body>
</html>
